```

### 3.4 InterviewReport / ReflectionReport

与「开发步骤」0.1 节一致；**入库动作只在 server_job**。

### 3.5 AI 任务请求 payload 示例（interview_ai_task）

```json
{
  "task_type": "reflection",
  "interview_session_id": "...",
  "student_id": "...",
  "plan_id": "...",
  "plan_version": 1,
  "context_ref": {
    "session_api": "/internal/interview/sessions/{id}/context-bundle",
    "auth": "service_token"
  },
